WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.420
Open the month's payroll, add overtime and bonuses, check the payslips and approve it.

2
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:13.080
Payroll keeps one run per month. Create the month here when it starts.

3
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:18.890
Choose the month and Create payroll. Everyone active is added with their salary.

4
00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:22.590
Open this month's draft.

5
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:28.800
The totals: gross, deductions, net to pay and what the mall pays on top.

6
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.890
Add overtime on someone's line.

7
00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:37.010
Or a bonus. Unpaid days and other deductions have their own columns.

8
00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:43.800
Save and recalculate. Social insurance, tax and advance instalments are worked out again.

9
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:50.330
Every line has its payslip, in English and Arabic, ready to print or send.

10
00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:58.840
When it is right, approve it. It is locked, and the salaries are posted to the books.

11
00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:05.090
Then download the bank file to pay everyone, and mark the payroll as paid.
